          {
            "title": "Comparing",
            "id": 62166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo imparato a creare e memorizzare valori, ma come facciamo a confrontarli?</p><p>Dobbiamo confrontare i numeri in situazioni come verificare che il PIN inserito da un utente corrisponda al PIN salvato.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enteredPin = \" /><text value=\"5448\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" expectedPin = \" /><text value=\"5440\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 62168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per confrontare se due numeri sono uguali, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di uguaglianza</strong>, <code>===</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"5 === 5\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True or false",
            "id": 62169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "c25f4263-3c52-44c4-b06e-9616458fc0eb"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confronti, ci sono solo due risultati: <code>true</code> o <code>false</code>.</p><img src=\"c25f4263-3c52-44c4-b06e-9616458fc0eb\" visible-if=\"always\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 62170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo gli stessi numeri con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>10</code>, seguito da <code>===</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo gli stessi numeri con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>true</code>.</p><p>Usa <code>===</code> per confrontare numeri uguali affinché la console stampi <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>10</code>, seguito da <code>===</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 62171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo due numeri diversi con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>false</code>.</p><p>Scegli l'opzione che confronta <code>9</code> con <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>9 === 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando confrontiamo due numeri diversi con l'operatore di uguaglianza, il risultato è <code>false</code>.</p><p>Usa l’operatore di uguaglianza per confrontare <code>9</code> con <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>, seguito da <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 62183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa usiamo per verificare se due numeri sono uguali? </p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>===</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa usiamo per verificare se due numeri sono uguali? Quale operatore fa sì che il confronto tra <code>7</code> e <code>7</code> restituisca <code>true</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>!==</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 62186,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I due valori di questo confronto sono diversi. Che cosa viene stampato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 62185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In quale di queste situazioni dovremmo verificare se due numeri sono uguali?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando controlli se il numero di vite rimanenti di un giocatore è <em>esattamente</em> 5</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando controlli se il numero di vite rimanenti di un giocatore è <em>minore o uguale a</em> 3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando controlli se il numero di vite rimanenti di un giocatore è <em>esattamente</em> 5.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salvi le vite rimaste in <code>lives</code>. Quale controllo verifica se il giocatore ha esattamente <code>5</code> vite?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>lives === 5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>lives = 5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>lives === 0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>lives === 5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 62187,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"18\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> e poi <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> e poi <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> e poi <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sostituisci <code>===</code> con <code>+</code> nella seconda riga. Cosa mostrano ora le due righe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"18\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">18 e poi 18</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">18 e poi false</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">false e poi 18</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 18 e poi 18.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 62184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica se il valore di <code>votes</code> è uguale a <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" votes = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(votes === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai in modo che il valore esistente di <code>votes</code> produca <code>false</code> quando viene confrontato con un numero diverso.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" votes = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(votes === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"votes\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>=</code> e infine <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 62198,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi l'operatore di confronto di uguaglianza.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il confronto in modo che la console stampi <code>false</code> per <code>99</code> e <code>100</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 62200,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>false</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa l'operatore di uguaglianza per confrontare <code>10</code> con la variabile <code>dogs</code> in modo che la console visualizzi <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dogs\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dogs\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Dogs\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>, seguito da <code>dogs</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 62199,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Controlla se questi numeri sono uguali digitando <code>===</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
