      {
        "id": 7178,
        "title": "Operatore di disuguaglianza",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Not equal",
            "id": 62182,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un numero non è uguale a un altro numero, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di disuguaglianza</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Result !==",
            "id": 62178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare il risultato di un confronto con l'operatore di disuguaglianza in una variabile.</p><p>Salva il confronto tra <code>1</code> e <code>2</code> nella variabile <code>result</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare il risultato di un confronto con l'operatore di disuguaglianza in una variabile.</p><p>Completa la riga affinché <code>result</code> stampi <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Result ===",
            "id": 62176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili possono memorizzare anche il risultato dei confronti di uguaglianza.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili possono memorizzare anche il risultato dei confronti di uguaglianza.</p><p>Completa la riga affinché <code>result</code> stampi <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare variables",
            "id": 62179,
